## Issue Description
The issue requests exporting SRAM ECC status signals to the top level, similar to what was implemented in the Caliptra VeeR core. The requester notes that "ECC errors may occur that render the VeeR core unable to execute recovery code" and that some ECC errors lack explicit reporting, making it difficult to diagnose corrupted bits during debugging.

